{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:f4d2cac0fb46a596","name":"Arranging the Assassination","source":{"id":"source:reference-f4d2cac0fb46a596","title":"Arranging the Assassination","revision":15924,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:53:25Z","sha256":"9338e89d231f269e6db582a1597a20ec5ba2b6f2f2054a77002266a0d5aad96c","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=15924","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Arranging%20the%20Assassination&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-f4d2cac0fb46a596","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The heroes travel to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Duro"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Duro","referenceId":"reference:649f085c70b1304a"},". Once they arrive in orbit around the planet, they can contact an ally of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Rebel Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebel_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:52c543ff6d31425c"}," in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Duro"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Duro","referenceId":"reference:649f085c70b1304a"}," corporate government. The heroes engage in a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"}," to talk the official into aiding their attempt on the Emperor's life.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Arranging the Assassination Statistics (CL 9)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Complexity:"]}," 3 (11 Successes before 3 Failures)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"},":"]}," The following are suggested Primary Skills for this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"},":\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},": 27):"]}," The heroes fabricate evidence that Emperor Palpatine is a direct threat to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Duros"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Duros","referenceId":"reference:a756a4ab3711a651"}," or that he has no intentions of honoring his contract. The argument might convince the official to give in to the heroes' request."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Galactic Lore)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Galactic_Lore)"}," (DC 23):"]}," The heroes recall something they know of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Duro"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Duro","referenceId":"reference:649f085c70b1304a"}," official, perhaps his past assistance to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Rebel Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebel_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:52c543ff6d31425c"},", that they can use as leverage."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Social Sciences)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Social_Sciences)"}," (DC 28):"]}," The heroes put forth a point of philosophy, well known on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Duro"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Duro","referenceId":"reference:649f085c70b1304a"},", that speaks to the official and convinces him that their plan is a necessary course of action."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},": 27):"]}," The heroes plead for the official to give them aid, using reason and promises of justice for the Emperor's dark deeds."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},": 27):"]}," The heroes attempt to detect the mood and surface thoughts of the official, which might help them avoid upsetting or offending him during the negotiation."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Challenge Effects"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The following are suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Challenge Effects"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Challenge_Effects"}," for this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"},":\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Opposed DC Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Opposed_DC_Challenge","referenceId":"reference:a45d2286e387f4dd"},":"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"}," used against the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Duro"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Duro","referenceId":"reference:649f085c70b1304a"}," government official, including ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"},", target the official's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"}," of 27."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Recovery"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Recovery","referenceId":"reference:48f6a8d5688b0cf5"},":"]}," Since the official has a history of aiding the Alliance, he is willing to listen despite his fear of being discovered. Any hero who succeeds on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," by 5 or more can forfeit that Success in exchange for removing one Failure."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Success and Failure"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Success:"]}," The heroes convince the official to give them special access to the building where Emperor Palpatine will negotiate the new ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ship"}," contract.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Failure:"]}," The official decides that the risks outweigh the potential benefits and refuses to help. The heroes must find their own way into the building. In addition, the official might warn his staff that intruders are expected.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
